      "html": "<div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-d5f86af2><section id=\"webinar-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full pb-24 max-md:pb-10 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto relative\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:6rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:2.5rem;\" data-v-d5f86af2 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"webinar-hero__layout grid items-start\" data-v-d5f86af2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-v-d5f86af2><div class=\"webinar-hero__headline flex flex-col gap-2 tracking-tight leading-tight\" data-v-d5f86af2><h1 class=\"text-slatecolor\" data-v-d5f86af2>Grow AI adoption &amp; measure what matters.</h1></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-d5f86af2><p data-v-d5f86af2>For leaders responsible for making AI work across their teams and workflows: operations, sales, marketing, finance, HR and beyond. If you've invested in AI and are now asking whether people are actually using it - and whether it's creating value - this session is for you. Give us your details and we'll email you the recording.</p><p data-v-d5f86af2>Buying AI is the easy part. Getting people to use it, share what works and trust it enough to do meaningful work is harder. And measuring tokens, licences or activity alone won't tell you whether your investment is paying off.</p><p data-v-d5f86af2>So what should you actually measure? And how do you turn AI from something people experiment with into something that becomes part of how work gets done?</p></div></div><div id=\"webinar-register-form\" class=\"webinar-hero__form flex flex-col gap-6 bg-slatecolor\" data-v-d5f86af2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 text-center text-2xl leading-normal tracking-tight\" data-v-d5f86af2><p class=\"text-3xl text-spark\" data-v-d5f86af2>Webinar Recording</p></div><form id=\"webinar-registration-form\" name=\"Webinar registration form\" class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" aria-label=\"Webinar recording request form\" data-v-d5f86af2><input value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"_honeypot\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sr-only\" data-v-d5f86af2><div class=\"webinar-hero__fields grid gap-6\" data-v-d5f86af2><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2\" data-v-d5f86af2><label for=\"webinar-first-name\" class=\"font-fono text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-tight uppercase text-chalk\">First name</label><input id=\"webinar-first-name\" name=\"firstname\" type=\"text\" value placeholder=\"Jane\" required maxlength=\"100\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" class=\"min-h-12 w-full rounded-lg px-4 text-input font-medium leading-none border-0 bg-haze-900/90 text-haze backdrop-blur-xs placeholder:text-haze/40 outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 scroll-mb-24 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal\"></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2\" data-v-d5f86af2><label for=\"webinar-last-name\" class=\"font-fono text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-tight uppercase text-chalk\">Last name</label><input id=\"webinar-last-name\" name=\"lastname\" type=\"text\" value placeholder=\"Smith\" required maxlength=\"100\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" class=\"min-h-12 w-full rounded-lg px-4 text-input font-medium leading-none border-0 bg-haze-900/90 text-haze backdrop-blur-xs placeholder:text-haze/40 outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 scroll-mb-24 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal\"></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2\" data-v-d5f86af2><label for=\"webinar-company\" class=\"font-fono text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-tight uppercase text-chalk\">Company</label><input id=\"webinar-company\" name=\"company\" type=\"text\" value placeholder=\"Acme Inc\" required autocomplete=\"organization\" class=\"min-h-12 w-full rounded-lg px-4 text-input font-medium leading-none border-0 bg-haze-900/90 text-haze backdrop-blur-xs placeholder:text-haze/40 outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 scroll-mb-24 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal\"></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2\" data-v-d5f86af2><label for=\"webinar-title\" class=\"font-fono text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-tight uppercase text-chalk\">Title</label><input id=\"webinar-title\" name=\"title\" type=\"text\" value placeholder=\"Head of Product\" required autocomplete=\"organization-title\" class=\"min-h-12 w-full rounded-lg px-4 text-input font-medium leading-none border-0 bg-haze-900/90 text-haze backdrop-blur-xs placeholder:text-haze/40 outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 scroll-mb-24 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal\"></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-2 col-span-full\" data-v-d5f86af2><label for=\"webinar-email\" class=\"font-fono text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-tight uppercase text-chalk\">Business email</label><input id=\"webinar-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" value placeholder=\"jane@acme.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\" class=\"min-h-12 w-full rounded-lg px-4 text-input font-medium leading-none border-0 bg-haze-900/90 text-haze backdrop-blur-xs placeholder:text-haze/40 outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 scroll-mb-24 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal\"></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-haze-300 text-slatecolor bg-chalk hover:bg-haze hover:border-haze-300 font-normal text-lg py-3 px-6 w-full\" aria-busy=\"false\" data-v-d5f86af2><span class=\"relative z-10\">Send me the recording</span></button></form></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-7516d1b1><section id=\"webinar-speakers\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-14 pt-12 pb-32 max-md:pt-8 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-7516d1b1 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"webinar-speakers__layout flex w-full flex-col gap-14\" data-v-7516d1b1><h2 class=\"webinar-speakers__heading tracking-tight text-spark\" data-v-7516d1b1>Speakers</h2><div class=\"webinar-speakers__grid grid gap-8\" data-v-7516d1b1><article class=\"webinar-speaker__card flex items-stretch gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-soft-grey p-4\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"webinar-speaker__photo shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"content-image content-image--fill size-full\" data-v-7516d1b1><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmoAAABXRUJQVlA4IF4AAABQBQCdASogACAAPzmUwFqvKaakKAgB4CcJYwDGfFaELVfie3CZOijipa3t1ct+lE8ByKAA/owtNWNs62G/Q9nSHZ+aEbc+92YbOMiXV6cDZUeIu3PtcCcCaJ3h3/AA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/team-members/jordan.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/team-members/jordan.gen.avif 896w\" sizes=\"192px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/team-members/jordan.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/team-members/jordan.gen.webp 896w\" sizes=\"192px\"><img src=\"/content-media/team-members/jordan.gen.jpg\" alt=\"Jordan Richards\" class=\"size-full object-cover content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div><div class=\"webinar-speaker__body flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-6 p-4\" data-v-7516d1b1>