9.81389C11.6486%209.81389%2010.7736%2010.4861%2010.7736%2011.8667V17.0458H7.76667V7.49306H10.6583V8.81667H10.6972C10.9875%208.22917%2012.0042%207.225%2013.5556%207.225C15.2333%207.225%2017.0458%208.22083%2017.0458%2011.1375L17.0444%2017.0458Z'%20fill='var(--fill-0,%20%23262626)'/%3e%3c/svg%3e\" alt=\"\" class=\"size-5\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-v-7516d1b1></a></div><p class=\"webinar-speaker__role min-w-0 text-base leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7516d1b1>CEO &amp; Co-Founder</p></div><p class=\"text-base leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor/70\" data-v-7516d1b1>Jordan works with leadership teams on turning AI from experimentation into systems that create real value. He has led AI and product work across more than 20 Google teams and brings practical experience of building AI into the way organisations actually work.</p></div></article><article class=\"webinar-speaker__card flex items-stretch gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-soft-grey p-4\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"webinar-speaker__photo shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"content-image content-image--fill size-full\" data-v-7516d1b1><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoAAAABXRUJQVlA4IHQAAACQBQCdASogACAAPzmOvlavKaajsBgIAeAnCWgAgnAZdNeGlhuBb2tBfCU1OhVIkKpG4JP0QAD+9xFwxlyzjqgmCp+qcAvH3FGd9wtcergIgDCL5bb3ZX5f50+24pTC0f1yV+Tu++CCZmZL7AihTh8qVFwAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/team-members/lewis-allison.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/team-members/lewis-allison.gen.avif 800w\" sizes=\"192px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/team-members/lewis-allison.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/team-members/lewis-allison.gen.webp 800w\" sizes=\"192px\"><img src=\"/content-media/team-members/lewis-allison.gen.jpg\" alt=\"Lewis Allison\" class=\"size-full object-cover content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div><div class=\"webinar-speaker__body flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-6 p-4\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"webinar-speaker__meta flex justify-between gap-2\" data-v-7516d1b1><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2\" data-v-7516d1b1><h3 class=\"text-2xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7516d1b1>Lewis</h3><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lewis-allison-0617a436/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Lewis on LinkedIn\" data-v-7516d1b1><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20preserveAspectRatio='none'%20width='100%25'%20height='100%25'%20overflow='visible'%20style='display:%20block;'%20viewBox='0%200%2020%2020'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cpath%20id='Vector'%20d='M18.5236%200H1.47639C1.08483%200%200.709301%200.155548%200.432425%200.432425C0.155548%200.709301%200%201.08483%200%201.47639V18.5236C0%2018.9152%200.155548%2019.2907%200.432425%2019.5676C0.709301%2019.8445%201.08483%2020%201.47639%2020H18.5236C18.9152%2020%2019.2907%2019.8445%2019.5676%2019.5676C19.8445%2019.2907%2020%2018.9152%2020%2018.5236V1.47639C20%201.08483%2019.8445%200.709301%2019.5676%200.432425C19.2907%200.155548%2018.9152%200%2018.5236%200ZM5.96111%2017.0375H2.95417V7.48611H5.96111V17.0375ZM4.45556%206.1625C4.11447%206.16058%203.7816%206.05766%203.49895%205.86674C3.21629%205.67582%202.99653%205.40544%202.8674%205.08974C2.73826%204.77404%202.70554%204.42716%202.77336%204.09288C2.84118%203.7586%203.0065%203.4519%203.24846%203.21148C3.49042%202.97107%203.79818%202.80772%204.13289%202.74205C4.4676%202.67638%204.81426%202.71133%205.12913%202.84249C5.44399%202.97365%205.71295%203.19514%205.90205%203.47901C6.09116%203.76288%206.19194%204.09641%206.19167%204.4375C6.19488%204.66586%206.15209%204.89253%206.06584%205.104C5.97959%205.31547%205.85165%205.50742%205.68964%205.66839C5.52763%205.82936%205.33487%205.95607%205.12285%206.04096C4.91083%206.12585%204.68389%206.16718%204.45556%206.1625ZM17.0444%2017.0458H14.0389V11.8278C14.0389%2010.2889%2013.3847%209.81389%2012.5403%209.81389C11.6486%209.81389%2010.7736%2010.4861%2010.7736%2011.8667V17.0458H7.76667V7.49306H10.6583V8.81667H10.6972C10.9875%208.22917%2012.0042%207.225%2013.5556%207.225C15.2333%207.225%2017.0458%208.22083%2017.0458%2011.1375L17.0444%2017.0458Z'%20fill='var(--fill-0,%20%23262626)'/%3e%3c/svg%3e\" alt=\"\" class=\"size-5\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-v-7516d1b1></a></div><p class=\"webinar-speaker__role min-w-0 text-base leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7516d1b1>Behavioural Strategist</p></div><p class=\"text-base leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor/70\" data-v-7516d1b1>Lewis applies behavioural science to help organisations change how people work. His experience spans Ogilvy, Google, HSBC, Peloton and more, helping teams understand what actually drives adoption and behaviour change.</p></div></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-85f6f074><section id=\"webinar-agenda\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-48 max-md:py-16 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-85f6f074 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"webinar-agenda__layout grid w-full items-stretch\" data-v-85f6f074><div class=\"webinar-agenda__copy flex flex-col gap-11\" data-v-85f6f074><div class=\"webinar-agenda__heading flex flex-col leading-tight tracking-tight\" data-v-85f6f074><p class=\"text-spark\" data-v-85f6f074>What we covered</p><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor\" data-v-85f6f074>In this short executive discussion, we explored:</h2></div><ul class=\"flex w-full flex-col border-t border-slatecolor/20\" data-v-85f6f074><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>Why AI usage isn't the same as AI value, and why token leaderboards can reward the wrong behaviour.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>The three stages of AI adoption: Usage, Shared and Trusted, and what to measure at each stage.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>How behavioural science can turn AI from something people try into something they actually use.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>Why managers are one of the biggest influences on AI adoption, and how to create the right social signals.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>How to move from individual AI experiments to shared skills, agents and workflows that compound value across the organisation.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>Why trust matters, and how quality, depth and autonomy can show whether AI is doing more meaningful work.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>How to balance automation with human judgement, so AI strengthens expertise rather than replacing it.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start border-b border-slatecolor/20 py-3\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"webinar-agenda__bullet mr-4 shrink-0 bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-85f6f074></span><span class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>Why adoption and measurement aren't separate problems, they're a continuous loop.</span></li></ul><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor/80\" data-v-85f6f074>Everyone who watches also gets access to our free AI Adoption Audit. Our dashboard helps you establish where your organisation is today, identify the biggest adoption frictions and understand what you should be measuring next across usage, shared value and trust.</p><div data-v-85f6f074><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-slate-dark shadow-button hover:bg-portal-surface hover:text-chalk font-normal text-lg py-3 px-4\" data-v-85f6f074><span class=\"relative z-10\">Watch the webinar</span></button></div></div><div class=\"webinar-agenda__media relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl\" data-v-85f6f074><div class=\"content-image absolute inset-0 size-full\" data-v-85f6f074><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmQAAABXRUJQVlA4IFgAAADwAwCdASogABUAPzmOvlSvKqajMAgB4CcJZQDE2Ayxk053dylX+niEAPxS3N9ifcwclFnr89lgvq8HT4w1vkmzJMpxoFo23Mvxwn3kgzT5lLzXWNbXMXAA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-1920w.avif 1920w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen.avif 3000w\" sizes=\"50vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen-1920w.webp 1920w, /content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen.webp 3000w\" sizes=\"50vw\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/about/about-carousel-meeting.gen.jpg\" alt=\"Team discussion in the Fyntix studio\" class=\"size-full object-cover content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></div></section></div></div>"
    },
